asset:        Colour palettes of the built-in theme presets (hex values only, no code or files copied)
used-in:      crates/ui-egui/src/theme/presets.rs
added:        2026-11-09 by Claude (agent)
notes:        Slots a scheme has no colour for are derived from its neighbours and marked
              "derived" in presets.rs. Readability fix-ups (accents nudged to 4.5:1) happen at
              runtime in Tokens::derive.

title:        Catppuccin (Latte, Frappé, Macchiato, Mocha)
author:       Catppuccin Org
source:       https://github.com/catppuccin/palette
license:      MIT

